!----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
!Variable descriptions
!---------------------
! NumParticles =		Number of particles
! NumChannels = 		Number of channels to be used in this calculation
! SpatialDim (double-prec) = 	Number of spatial dimensions
! NumAllChan = 		   	Number of total channels in the input potential file (may be more than what we want to use)
! massi =    			mass of ith particle
! xMin = 			Start of R-matrix prop radius
! xMax =			End of R-matrix prop radius
! xNumPoints =			Number of radial grid points per box
! NumBoxes =			Number of R-matrix Boxes (1 seed box at xMin from the literature
!                               R-matrix + (NumBoxes-1) real propagation boxes spanning xMin to xMax)
! Left =     			Boundary condition at xMin (unused for the Baluja seeded-box test)
! Right =			Boundary condition at xMax
! Energy =			Energy in the CalcGamLam convention, i.e. k^2/2 -- the Baluja et al.
!                               test case uses 2.5 Rydberg = k_1^2, so Energy=1.25d0 here.
!                               mass1=mass2=2.0 (-> reducedmass=1.0) matches the paper's
!                               Rydberg-unit convention (2*reducedmass=1 in the kinetic term).
!----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
